\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 No plan for the future. No plan for climate change. No plan for skills, no plan for nation building infrastructure, no plan to grow the economy, no plan for national reconstruction, no plan to increase the economic participation of }
