\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2  Scott Morrison has today said he's a bulldozer, that is a bulldozer wrecks things. A bulldozer knock things over. I'm a builder. }{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24
\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0
\ulnone\cf2 That's what I am and if I'm elected prime minister, I'll build things in this country. I'll build better infrastructure, I'll build a response to climate change. So in partnership with our allies, including the Biden administration, I'll build the skills capacity of this nation up, I'll build people's living standards up as well. }
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 I find it quite extraordinary that this government had been there for almost a decade. }{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj
\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 This prime minister has four years in office. And what he's saying is, if you vote for Scott Morrison, I'll change. That's really saying vote for me, and I'll change well, if you want change, change the government change because we can't just have three more years of the same and Scott Morrison. }
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 If this government is re-elected. It will be more arrogant, more out of touch. It will abuse taxpayers money and treat it like Liberal party money, even more so than it has during this term. }{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24
\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0
\ulnone\cf2 This is a government of Abbott, Turnbull and Morrison and nothing quite says the law of diminishing returns like Abbott, Turnbull, Morrison. They've got worse, they've got more arrogant, they've got more out of touch. And now the prime minister is putting his hand up and saying, I'll change. Well, if you want change, change the government on 21 May.}
