\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 ...I don't question that. I have learnt he was there in the 1980s and I'm sure he had many opinions on that, but can I tell you one of the most important things that we have done, when I first became prime minister, [Fijian] prime minister Frank Bainimarama came to Australia and I hosted him at Kirribilli and there was the formal part of the meeting but Frank and I walked out on to the terrace and I said to Frank, 'Frank, I know that Australia has not always done it the right way in the Pacific. You know, in the past Australia has acted a bit like a colonial overlord and stomped around and I don't think it's treated the Pacific peoples and families with respect.'}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
