\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Well, as I said, unfortunately we're seeing a time these days where, you know, the people are perhaps not as safe to be able to be walking down the street. But as I said, the prime minister did go to the Royal Sydney Show and engage with a number of people that were at the show, which was a fantastic opportunity for him to engage with people out on the ground during the Easter break. }
